                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game in it's current format is completely unplayable. The game breaks entirely by day 31, and even though I had only made one film by that point, I really was not totally upset by not having to play any more. The game lacks any real feedback on what makes good combinations for the most part and the lack of customisation is extremely disappointing. For example, I decide to make a film set in the Stone Age, but there are no Stone Age themed characters. Then at day 31, the game shows a pop-up that regenerates infinitely. It is quite incredible how disappointing this turned out to be. Then there is the fact that the game required me to install an additional application just to run which I was not expecting and it is extremely poorly translated in places. These issues and the droning music barely seem worth mentioning in comparison to the abject awfulness of the main game. Spend that money on almost anything else.",
